#. module: l10n_cssk_recycling_fee_sale
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_recycling_fee_sale.field_sale_order__recycling_fee_presentation
msgid ""
"Included: the fee is part of the unit price and each line says 'z toho "
"recyklační příspěvek …' — the presentation of MŽP's model invoices (unit "
"price 'vč. příspěvku na recyklaci'). On top: prices exclude the fee and it "
"is invoiced as its own line; the product line then states the fee as a "
"separate item. Both satisfy CZ § 73 odst. 1 and SK § 34 ods. 1 písm. d), "
"which require the fee to be stated separately, not how."
msgstr ""

